// advanced — the TRIANGLE-vulnerable enemy (#29 matrix: Advanced → Triangle).
//
// The body IS the tell (#27's 2026-06-09 shape-based-not-colour-only lock): the
// committed `prim_ramp` wedge, whose triangular faces sit at its local ±X. The
// 90° yaw turns those faces toward the ±Z Follow / Capture camera, so what you
// see from the playing angle is the triangle you have to draw. Colour (violet)
// only reinforces it.
//
// Reuses the gray-box primitive the collide item already ships and bake-tests —
// no new mesh. Distinct modelled bodies per kind stay deferred (#26).
Prefab(
    mesh: Some("prim_ramp"),
    role: "enemy",
    kind: Some("advanced"),
    rot: (0.0, 1.5708, 0.0),
    scale: (0.20, 0.20, 0.20),
    material: Some((diffuse: (170, 110, 220), ambient: (40, 26, 52))),
)
